<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Guests</h1>
<p>A new character starts out as a guest. A guest isn't stored anywhere yet: 
if you quit, or lose your connection and don't come back in time, the 
character is gone for good, with everything you did.
</p><p>To keep your character, type <a cmd='#'>save</a>. You'll see "You are no longer a guest 
on this game", and from then on your character is kept, and saved again 
when you quit, lose your link or the game reboots. Until then, <a cmd='#'>score</a> reminds you: "You remain a 
GUEST until you 'save' yourself".
</p><p>Do it early, as soon as you've made a character you like.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
<pre>&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Save</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Quit</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Score</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Newbie</a>
</pre>




</div>